### Vendor Report - All Data
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/vendor/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Vendor Report - Date Range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/vendor/?date_from=2026-01-01&date_to=2026-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Vendor Report - Specific Vendor
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/vendor/?vendor=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Vendor Report - Payment Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/vendor/?payment_status=overdue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Vendor Report - Payment Term
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/vendor/?payment_term=30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Vendor Report - Graph Filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/vendor/?chart_year=2025&graph_year=2026&graph_month=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Vendor Report - Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/vendor/?page=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Vendor Report - Combined Filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/vendor/?date_from=2026-01-01&date_to=2026-10-31&vendor=1&payment_status=paid&chart_year=2026&graph_year=2026&graph_month=10&page=1&page_size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
